            Calculate loan amortization schedules with principal, interest, and balance breakdowns.
          </p>
          <details class="fa-accordion text-sm">
            <summary class="fa-accordion-summary font-semibold">View Example</summary>
            <pre
              class="fa-prompt-panel mt-2"><code>&lbrace;
  "principal": 300000,
  "annualRate": 0.045,
  "years": 30,
  "startDate": "2025-01-01"
&rbrace;</code></pre>
